-maths-ch05-t02-i11","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i07","c1-maths-ch05-t02-i08"],"skill":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s4","turns":[{"who":"child","text":"पाँच?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, paanch bachche bache. Ab peeche ginne ki baari. Saat se shuru karo aur teen kadam peeche gino. Kahan pahunche?"},{"who":"child","text":"चार?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, chaar par pahunche. Ab aath se shuru karo aur teen kadam peeche gino. Kahan pahunche?"},{"who":"child","text":"पाँच?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, aath se teen kadam peeche jaakar paanch par pahunche. Ab do samoohon ko dekho. Riya ke paas paanch choodiyaan hain, Zoya ke paas teen. Riya ke paas kitni zyada hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"कलेक्शन दिखाओ ना..."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, choodiyon ka collection dikhati hoon. Yeh paanch Riya ki hain, aur teen Zoya ki. Ek ek jodi banao. Riya ki kitni choodiyaan zyada bachti hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... दो?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, Riya ki do choodiyaan zyada hain. Ab run socho. Jeetne ke liye saat run chahiye, aur tumne chaar bana liye. Aur kitne run chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... पता नहीं..."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Koi baat nahi. Chaar run ban chuke hain. Paanch run tak pahunchne ke liye aur kitna run chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... तीन?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, teen run aur chahiye. Ab toffee dekho. Haath mein paanch toffee hon, to teen hata sakte ho ya paanch?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... 5 − 3... कर सकते हैं?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, paanch toffee mein se teen hata sakte ho. Bholu kehta hai, teen mein se paanch hatana bhi wahi baat hai. Kya Bholu sahi hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... हाँ, शायद सही है?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumhe lag raha hai ki kram badalne se bhi wahi jawab aayega. Ab in teen toffee ko dekho. Paanch toffee hatani hon, to kya itni toffee hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"नहीं... तीन में से पाँच नहीं हटा सकते।"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, teen mein se paanch nahi hata sakte. Ab ulta socho. Paanch mein se teen hatao, to do bachte hain. Teen aur do milakar kitne hote hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... साइड में drawing दिखाओ ना?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, toffee ki drawing dikhati hoon. Ek taraf teen toffee hain, doosri taraf do. Dono taraf ki toffee milakar kitni hui?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... तीन और दो... पाँच?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne paanch kaha. Teen aur do milkar paanch hote hain. Isliye paanch mein se teen hatao, to do bachte hain. Aaj yahin rukna chahoge?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.08175,"tokens":47366},"boards":12,"lastMs":5324,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["3 + 2 = 5","5 − 3 = 2"],"words":"the board shows writing; written on it: 3 + 2 = 5; 5 − 3 = 2"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s1":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i01","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i09","kind":"near_transfer"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Do alag hatane ki kahaniyon mein sahi"},"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s2":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i04","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i11","kind":"far_transfer"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Choodiyon aur run, dono mein sahi"},"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s3":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i03","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i10","kind":"translate_rep"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Do alag peeche ginne ke sawaal sahi"},"c1-maths-ch05-t02-s4":{"read":"partly","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i07","kind":"contrast"},{"g":"wrong(c1-maths-ch05-t02-mc-any-order)","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i08","kind":"error_spot"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch05-t02-i08","kind":"error_spot"}],"grades":["correct","wrong(c1-maths-ch05-t02-mc-any-order)","correct"],"evidence":"Jod ka jawab diya; verified grade nahi","misconceptions":["c1-maths-ch05-t02-mc-any-order"]}},"pictures":0